Source: lazyvim-git
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/LazyVim/LazyVim

Package: lazyvim-git
Architecture: all
# Data-only Neovim config snapshot (mirrors the RPM spec, which carries no
# runtime Requires either).
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Neovim setup for lazy people (git snapshot)
 LazyVim is a Neovim setup powered by lazy.nvim to make it easy to
 customize and extend your configuration.
